:: Statement-only formalization of thousand-theorems corpus artifact Q1457052,
:: "Well-ordering theorem": every set admits a relation that well-orders it.
:: This file contains no proof.

environ
  vocabularies RELAT_1, RELAT_2, WELLORD1;
  notations RELAT_1, RELAT_2, WELLORD1;
  constructors RELAT_2, WELLORD1;
  registrations RELAT_1, WELLORD1;

begin

::$P-
theorem
  for X being set ex R being Relation st R well_orders X
proof
end;
::$P+
